# Database migrations live in this folder.

Rules (see AGENTS.md):
- Never modify an existing migration; always add a new one.
- Every migration must implement a working `down()` (reversible).
- `synchronize` stays `false`; schema changes go through migrations only.

Migrations are generated with the standalone DataSource in
`../data-source.ts` (added in Phase 3 together with the first entities).
